(7401737, 1165197, 16241, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2015-09-02 04:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7401738, 1165713, 16241, '<td valign="top">perfect</td>', 'perfect', '2015-09-02 04:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7401750, 1165075, 6519, '<td valign="top">Meeting the challenge is important to me.<br/>However, I do try to be open minded and try really, really hard to see connections that may not be totally obvious right away.<br/> <br/>Sadly, this is not doing it for me. I can''t find any connection to the topic. There is zero interesting stuff going on. There is very little attempt at creating anything interesting. I can only find (when I try VERY VERY VERY hard) anything positive at all...... such as yes, the leaves are in good focus.<br/> <br/>I have no idea why you entered this. I have even less idea why you entered a pic of sky and leaves in a challenge called "human hands". Maybe you actually have a reason? I look forward to finding out what that reason may be.</td>', 'Meeting the challenge is important to me.However, I do try to be open minded and try really, really hard to see connections that may not be totally obvious right away. Sadly, this is not doing it for me. I can''t find any connection to the topic. There is zero interesting stuff going on. There is very little attempt at creating anything interesting. I can only find (when I try VERY VERY VERY hard) anything positive at all...... such as yes, the leaves are in good focus. I have no idea why you entered this. I have even less idea why you entered a pic of sky and leaves in a challenge called "human hands". Maybe you actually have a reason? I look forward to finding out what that reason may be.', '2015-09-02 06:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7401751, 1165699, 6519, '<td valign="top">Oh my....... I guess something went a bit amiss with with title..... ouch.</td>', 'Oh my....... I guess something went a bit amiss with with title..... ouch.', '2015-09-02 06:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7401752, 1165648, 6519, '<td valign="top">Be honest...... if you asked 100 people: "What is the subject of this photo? What is the most important part of it?" How often you do think "human hands" or even "a hand" would be the answer? My guess is........1 (one) if you''re really, really lucky. I do like the shot, but not so much for THIS challenge.<br/>Shoehorn :-(</td>', 'Be honest...... if you asked 100 people: "What is the subject of this photo? What is the most important part of it?" How often you do think "human hands" or even "a hand" would be the answer? My guess is........1 (one) if you''re really, really lucky. I do like the shot, but not so much for THIS challenge.Shoehorn :-(', '2015-09-02 06:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7401780, 1165560, 100831, '<td valign="top">goodbye summer!!! Have fun in school!!!</td>', 'goodbye summer!!! Have fun in school!!!', '2015-09-02 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7401813, 1165197, 174999, '<td valign="top">Not voting, I just keep coming back to this photo,  this really made me super emotional and made me cry. It reminds me of my grandmother and how she taught me how to crotchet and knit, This pasttime I think has fallen and no one ever does it. It makes me wish I was in photography when my grandmother was alive because I would so want this photo.<br/> <br/>If this doesn''t come in the top 5 (should be a blue) I will cry. Anything less of the top is injustice to this image and should be "shamed" to the voters.<br/> <br/>This is just so superb, well done and emotional! I think this will do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Not voting, I just keep coming back to this photo,  this really made me super emotional and made me cry. It reminds me of my grandmother and how she taught me how to crotchet and knit, This pasttime I think has fallen and no one ever does it. It makes me wish I was in photography when my grandmother was alive because I would so want this photo. If this doesn''t come in the top 5 (should be a blue) I will cry. Anything less of the top is injustice to this image and should be "shamed" to the voters. This is just so superb, well done and emotional! I think this will do well in the challenge.', '2015-09-02 10:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
