(7402975, 1165716, 106110, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but feel that if the photos were stacked the other way around it would feel more like taking back. To me how they are layered feels like the fist is being opened up and something is being released.</td>', 'I like the concept but feel that if the photos were stacked the other way around it would feel more like taking back. To me how they are layered feels like the fist is being opened up and something is being released.', '2015-09-07 01:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
