(7403111, 1165403, 62249, '<td valign="top">Works well in black and white. Interesting combination of street photography and the challenge theme.</td>', 'Works well in black and white. Interesting combination of street photography and the challenge theme.', '2015-09-07 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403112, 1165560, 62249, '<td valign="top">Four days to go until what? Not sure the texture overlay helps this image especially. The grain works, but the splotches are a distraction from the underlying image, which is quite lovely.</td>', 'Four days to go until what? Not sure the texture overlay helps this image especially. The grain works, but the splotches are a distraction from the underlying image, which is quite lovely.', '2015-09-07 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403113, 1165668, 62249, '<td valign="top">All together now: Awwwwwwww. Very cute. Well lit. Great DOF.</td>', 'All together now: Awwwwwwww. Very cute. Well lit. Great DOF.', '2015-09-07 12:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403114, 1165566, 62249, '<td valign="top">Black and white is a good choice. The graininess of the hands seems at odds with the noticeably less grainy sleeve in the lower part. And there''s an odd too sharp line where the lower hand meets the background (on the left edge where the palm meets the wrist.</td>', 'Black and white is a good choice. The graininess of the hands seems at odds with the noticeably less grainy sleeve in the lower part. And there''s an odd too sharp line where the lower hand meets the background (on the left edge where the palm meets the wrist.', '2015-09-07 12:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403115, 1165179, 62249, '<td valign="top">The birds are the real subject of this image, not the hand.</td>', 'The birds are the real subject of this image, not the hand.', '2015-09-07 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403117, 1165748, 62249, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop a little tighter on the bottom to remove the little bit of the upper lip that''s visible. I either want to see more of the mouth or none of the mouth.</td>', 'Maybe crop a little tighter on the bottom to remove the little bit of the upper lip that''s visible. I either want to see more of the mouth or none of the mouth.', '2015-09-07 12:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403118, 1165741, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice. Working hands in context. Well exposed, and the image tells a little story.</td>', 'Nice. Working hands in context. Well exposed, and the image tells a little story.', '2015-09-07 12:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403120, 1165709, 62249, '<td valign="top">The overhead angle is a creative take on this challenge. There''s a lot going on in the image, and honestly, I notice the noses and the toes before I notice the hands.</td>', 'The overhead angle is a creative take on this challenge. There''s a lot going on in the image, and honestly, I notice the noses and the toes before I notice the hands.', '2015-09-07 12:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403122, 1165699, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and perfect use of DOF for the baskets. Needs a title other than the file name.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and perfect use of DOF for the baskets. Needs a title other than the file name.', '2015-09-07 12:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403123, 1165570, 62249, '<td valign="top">Coooool. Love the bokeh and the overall processing.</td>', 'Coooool. Love the bokeh and the overall processing.', '2015-09-07 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403124, 1165702, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more light bounced into the cupped hands.</td>', 'Needs a bit more light bounced into the cupped hands.', '2015-09-07 12:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403126, 1165331, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting casts a harsh shadow and gray tones look murky overall. Hands aren''t doing anything particularly interesting.</td>', 'Lighting casts a harsh shadow and gray tones look murky overall. Hands aren''t doing anything particularly interesting.', '2015-09-07 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403127, 1165476, 62249, '<td valign="top">Funny. works well in b/w, and good choice of processing filter(s) for this image.</td>', 'Funny. works well in b/w, and good choice of processing filter(s) for this image.', '2015-09-07 12:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403128, 1165648, 62249, '<td valign="top">The lighting, set, and model are all lovely. The hand seems almost an afterthought.</td>', 'The lighting, set, and model are all lovely. The hand seems almost an afterthought.', '2015-09-07 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403129, 1165585, 62249, '<td valign="top">A lovely image of a beautiful woman.</td>', 'A lovely image of a beautiful woman.', '2015-09-07 12:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403132, 1165637, 62249, '<td valign="top">A bit overprocessed, but a well composed and interesting image nonetheless.</td>', 'A bit overprocessed, but a well composed and interesting image nonetheless.', '2015-09-07 12:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403139, 1165715, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of very young and very old hands. The processing needs work. Tonal range is too gray overall, and you''ve got some unattractive halos along the edges.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of very young and very old hands. The processing needs work. Tonal range is too gray overall, and you''ve got some unattractive halos along the edges.', '2015-09-07 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403142, 1165301, 62249, '<td valign="top">Seems kinda murky overall. The hands aren''t well lit.</td>', 'Seems kinda murky overall. The hands aren''t well lit.', '2015-09-07 12:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403143, 1165425, 62249, '<td valign="top">I appreciate what you were going for in this shot. Honestly, though, I wish you''d skipped the sign/billboard and just cropped in on the hands and shadow against the wall/pillar. That part of the image is excellent!</td>', 'I appreciate what you were going for in this shot. Honestly, though, I wish you''d skipped the sign/billboard and just cropped in on the hands and shadow against the wall/pillar. That part of the image is excellent!', '2015-09-07 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403145, 1165070, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting is casting very harsh shadows.</td>', 'Lighting is casting very harsh shadows.', '2015-09-07 12:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403146, 1165143, 62249, '<td valign="top">Clever and amusing.</td>', 'Clever and amusing.', '2015-09-07 12:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403176, 1165566, 63218, '<td valign="top">I had an unexpected reaction to this, as I see the old hand holding the younger one down in a gesture of surrender, like they were arm-wrestling &amp; the younger arm lost. It''s probably because of my uneasy relationship with my mother. But then there''s that BW grittiness. It would''ve been a completely different feeling if the older hand was on the bottom, palm up. Anyway...</td>', 'I had an unexpected reaction to this, as I see the old hand holding the younger one down in a gesture of surrender, like they were arm-wrestling & the younger arm lost. It''s probably because of my uneasy relationship with my mother. But then there''s that BW grittiness. It would''ve been a completely different feeling if the older hand was on the bottom, palm up. Anyway...', '2015-09-07 14:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403177, 1165179, 63218, '<td valign="top">The stamp on the hand is a nice touch, I wonder where you were?</td>', 'The stamp on the hand is a nice touch, I wonder where you were?', '2015-09-07 15:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403178, 1165742, 63218, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at the rings...interesting...&amp; wondering if you used your own cellphone? probably not, not with that DOF.</td>', 'I''m looking at the rings...interesting...& wondering if you used your own cellphone? probably not, not with that DOF.', '2015-09-07 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
