(7403206, 1165606, 63218, '<td valign="top">that''s a lot of space, so they might be Americans, but then they''re both smoking, so maybe not.</td>', 'that''s a lot of space, so they might be Americans, but then they''re both smoking, so maybe not.', '2015-09-07 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
