(7403208, 1165331, 63218, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at the nail polish, trying to figure out the lumps in it. Not air bubbles, maybe confetti...I don''t know, it looks metallic. It looks like a no contract phone. Not much is happening, here, though.</td>', 'I''m looking at the nail polish, trying to figure out the lumps in it. Not air bubbles, maybe confetti...I don''t know, it looks metallic. It looks like a no contract phone. Not much is happening, here, though.', '2015-09-07 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
