(7403707, 1165197, 179769, '<td valign="top">Whut??   Oh, WOW!   My first ribbon!   These are my 90-year-old Mom''s beautiful old hands.   She was a knitter, not a crocheter, but couldn''t find her needles for our shoot.  She does neither now because of arthritis.  She was a good sport to pose for me, though. :-)  I think I will always treasure this photo....<br/> <br/>Thank you everyone for the kind comments and votes!</td>', 'Whut??   Oh, WOW!   My first ribbon!   These are my 90-year-old Mom''s beautiful old hands.   She was a knitter, not a crocheter, but couldn''t find her needles for our shoot.  She does neither now because of arthritis.  She was a good sport to pose for me, though. :-)  I think I will always treasure this photo.... Thank you everyone for the kind comments and votes!', '2015-09-09 01:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
